  "accepted_answers": [
    "21 July 2017",
    "Aug 17, 2017"
  ],
  "explanation": "The question asks for the release date of Splatoon 2. Source D2S1 explicitly states the game was 'released worldwide on 21 July 2017', which is the primary global release date. Source D1S1 mentions 'Aug 17, 2017' in the context of a 'Switch bundle' announcement, which represents a specific regional bundle release date (North America) rather than the initial global launch, but it is a valid release event for the product mentioned in the text. Source D3S1 claims a release date of 'July 1, 2007', which contradicts the 2016 teaser date mentioned in the same sentence and is factually impossible for a Nintendo Switch game; this is treated as a hallucination/error in the source text. Therefore, both 21 July 2017 and Aug 17, 2017 are preserved as distinct valid referents for different release contexts, while July 1, 2007 is rejected."
}
